[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こいつで！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Take this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "終わりだよぉっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's over!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（あ、また！\u3000あれに触ったから、ルトガーは）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Ah, there it is! Rutger must have touched that thing...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？\u3000変な石ね。何かしら、もしかして食べられる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm? That's a strange stone. Wonder if it's edible?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だ、ダメ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no, don't!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え？\u3000どうしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "操られて……ない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you... not being controlled?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アイラ。何か分かったことがあるのですね？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla. You've figured something out, haven't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えっとつまり、ルトガーさんが操られていたのは\nその石が原因じゃないかと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So basically, you think that stone might be what was controlling Rutger?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。ヴァレリアに殴られた時、\n懐から石がぽろっと落ちたんだよね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. When Valeria knocked him down, this stone fell from his pocket."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それからルトガーも正気を取り戻したし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that's when he came back to his senses."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "となると、魔物たちも操られていた可能性が\nありますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If that's the case, it's possible the monsters were being controlled as well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "マジかよ！？\u3000あの石が？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you serious!? That little stone?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そんな馬鹿なことがあるかよ。オレの嗅覚じゃ、\nこいつは希少な鉱石だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's ridiculous. My nose tells me this is just a rare mineral."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょ、ダメだって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, I said don't touch it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうせ独り占めしようとして、いい加減なこと――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're probably just making things up to keep it for your—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うっ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "てーいっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hyah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "例の抉れた地面の近くで、そいつを拾ったんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I found it near that gouged-out area in the ground."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ルトガーの様子がおかしくなったの、\nそれからだよねぇ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And that's when you started acting strange, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "......"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから言ったじゃん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I told you so!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これではっきりしましたね。今、この島には\nこの不可解な石が存在します",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, this confirms it. There are mysterious stones on this island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そのせいで異常な状況が起きている。「青の領域」の\n存在にも関係している可能性がありますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "They're causing these abnormal situations. They might even be connected to the existence of the blue zone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずは他の皆さんにも状況を伝えましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We should let everyone else know about this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "石も調べてみたほうがいいな。ヴァレリア、\nお前、影響受けなかったろ？\u3000持っとけよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We ought to examine that stone too. Valeria, you weren't affected by it, right? Better hold onto it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かったわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ただしだな、少しでも具合が悪かったら\nすぐに言うんだぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just make sure you tell us right away if you start feeling off."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "分かってる分かってる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, yes, I know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おい。大丈夫なのかよ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey. Are you sure you'll be alright!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。もしかしたら私が普通じゃないから\nなのかもしれないしね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Maybe it's just because I'm not exactly normal myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "普通じゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not normal?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さて。話が決まったところで、アトリエに\n向かいましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then. Now that that's settled, let's head to the atelier."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]